{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"sapphire-cosmogonic-cob","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context / Problem\n\nThe canonical registry at `src/rebar/_deprecations.py:94-112` schedules three removals: `transition(force_close=...)`, boolean `transition(force=True)`, and hosted `openai-chat:` selection. The Responses migration `upbeat-illadvised-springtail` is closed, so the narrow hosted-OpenAI removal is now eligible.\n\n## Approach\n\nDelete the scheduled aliases and require their canonical forms: reason-bearing `force=\"<reason>\"` and hosted `openai-responses:<model>`. Preserve custom OpenAI-compatible endpoints on Chat Completions; they are not the hosted surface being removed. Update release material, generated references, schemas, examples, and tests as a deliberate pre-1.0 break.\n\n## Scope\n\n- deprecation registry and transition/provider parsing\n- CLI/Python/MCP schemas and documentation/examples\n- changelog/release notes and focused compatibility tests\n\n## Testing\n\nCover each removed spelling failing at its public boundary, canonical replacements succeeding, and a custom endpoint still using Chat Completions.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `force_close=` and boolean `force=True` are rejected; `force=\"<explicit reason>\"` remains accepted.\n- [ ] Hosted `openai-chat:` selection is rejected; hosted `openai-responses:` works.\n- [ ] Custom OpenAI-compatible endpoints retain their Chat Completions dialect.\n- [ ] Changelog, release notes, schemas, generated references, examples, and tests record the breaking replacements.","id":"828b-fe4a-b05a-48fb","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","priority":2,"tags":["janitor","deprecation","breaking-change","compatibility"],"ticket_type":"story","title":"Remove the three scheduled public deprecations"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788314214336944001,"uuid":"490dd8b1-0787-41bf-ba93-091b26c4c7f6"}